################################################################################################
#  Name			:  denomdp053.scr
#  Date			:  19-JUL-2010
#  Description		:  This script fetches the rate code and populates the same in the frontend.
#  Input		:  From Currency, To Currency from JSP
#  Output		:  Rate code
#  Author		:  Sandeep Patil
#  Calling JSP		:  None
#  Menu Option		:  HCASHDX
#  MODULE CODE		:  DENOM
#  Modification History	:
#	<Sr. No.>	<Date>			<Author>		<Description>
